                                "sense_id": "fcaf9ef7-df8a-3cb1-a925-ff00a86966d4",
                                "text": "Since he entered the race more than a week ago, Joe Biden has been citing his connection with middle-class, Rust Belt voters to cast himself as the most electable Democrat in the field — a theory that seems to have gotten some traction with voters."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1cce26c8-1e40-4239-8386-34de97cbfaaa",
                                "sense_id": "fcaf9ef7-df8a-3cb1-a925-ff00a86966d4",
                                "text": "So where are you supposed to find a comfortably electable, qualified candidate who won’t turn 80 while in office?"
                            }
                        ]
